WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:06.730
SCP-096, the Shy Guy, versus SCP-2599, the
reality bender named Zena Cho.

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:11.010
Who comes out on top in a confrontation between
these two incredibly powerful anomalies?

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.090
Let’s find out.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:18.521
SCP-2599 is a 14-year-old girl who is incapable
of disobeying any command given to her, but

00:00:18.521 --> 00:00:22.200
also incapable of successfully carrying out
that command fully.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.100
She can come close, but never quite reach
the goal she is given, which can allow for

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.460
some powerful reality-bending.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:34.879
In a test, 2599 was told to neutralize 096,
and she maneuvered and outwitted SCP-096’s

00:00:34.879 --> 00:00:38.149
frenzied rage state, landing a few hits on
the entity.

00:00:38.149 --> 00:00:43.999
But with 096 being as terrifyingly relentless
as he is, 2599 only reached the halfway mark

00:00:43.999 --> 00:00:49.370
in her execution She came incredibly close
to neutralizing the entity, but in the end,

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:54.649
her anomalous nature demands that SCP-096
undeniably comes out on top.

